      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Village life, done right.\r\n\r\nNo. 2 Old Court is a superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom mid-terrace home right in the heart of Drumconrath village. Extending to c. 1,100 sq. ft. , the property combines a practical layout with a private rear garden, off-street parking and a strong B2 BER rating.\r\n\r\nInside, the ground floor is bright and welcoming, with a good-sized living room featuring a fireplace, along with a fitted kitchen and adjoining dining area. Upstairs are three bedrooms and two bathrooms, providing well-proportioned accommodation for a couple, family or anyone looking for a manageable home in a village setting.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a fenced and private rear garden with a sunny aspect. There is gated access to off-street parking at the rear, while the garden provides a useful and pleasant outdoor space.\r\n\r\nThe location is a particular strength. No. 2 Old Court sits right on the ege of Drumconrath, with the local shop, school, pubs and everyday village amenities all within easy walking distance. The village has a strong sense of community and a picturesque rural setting, while larger towns are readily accessible. Ardee is approximately 8km away, with Carrickmacross, Navan and Drogheda also within easy reach. The M1 motorway provides straightforward access towards Dublin for commuters.\r\n\r\nThe B2 BER is a further plus, adding to what is already a very appealing package.\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms. c. 1,100 sq. ft. B2 rated. Private garden. Off-street parking. And village life on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nKey details:\r\n• Three-bedroom, two-bathroom mid-terrace home\r\n• Extending to c. 1,100 sq. ft. (102 sq. m.)\r\n• B2 BER\r\n• Off-street parking to the rear\r\n• Gated rear access\r\n• Oil-fired central heating\r\n• Mains water and sewerage\r\n• Wired for alarm\r\n• Good internet connectivity\r\n• Central Drumconrath village location\r\n• c. 8km from Ardee\r\n• Eircode: C15 E0K2"
      },
      {
